NAVAREA XIX 114/26
1.THE NORWEGIAN GOVERNMENT HAS DECIDED THAT&NBSP;
RUSSIAN FISHING VESSELS ONLY HAVE ACCESS TO THE&NBSP;
FOLLOWING THREE PORTS ON THE NORWEGIAN MAINLAND:
&NBSP;
A.BAATSFJORD (NOBJF)
B.KIRKENES (NOKKN)
C.TROMSOE (NOTOS)
&NBSP;
A BAN ON ACCESS TO OTHER PORTS ON THE NORWEGIAN MAINLAND
WILL APPLY FOR RUSSIAN FISHING VESSELS FROM 132200 UTC OCT 2022.
2. CANCEL NAVAREA XIX&NBSP; 45/26
